 GitHub organization avatar is a default identicon and is deliberately not used.","language","en","获取方式","sdk","access","section","源码",[80],{"_61":81,"_25":82,"_83":84},"Unreal engine SDK source","https://github.com/Conv-AI/Convai-UnrealEngine-SDK-V4","note","Public engine integration source; the complete cloud conversation service is not included.","interactive","演示",[88],{"_61":89,"_25":90,"_83":91},"Try character experiences","https://x.convai.com/","Account-required browser character experiences; these are conversations and role-play, not complete game-generation demos.","教程",[94],{"_61":95,"_25":96,"_83":97},"Build your first AI character","https://docs.convai.com/api-docs/plugins-and-integrations/convai-unity-sdk/getting-started","Official Unity installation, service setup, sample-scene, and custom-character walkthrough.","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","metadata","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[108],"dimensions","3D","开发阶段",[112,113,114],"stages","玩法与代码","引擎与场景","运行时 AI 与 NPC","主题",[118,119,120,121],"tags","运行时 AI","NPC dialogue","Character actions","Unity / Unreal","延伸阅读",[124,125,126],{"_61":130,"_25":131},{"_61":129,"_25":82},{"_61":127,"_25":128},"Projects and experiences","https://convai.com/gallery","Unreal SDK source","Unity SDK documentation","https://docs.convai.com/api-docs/plugins-and-integrations/convai-unity-sdk","项目源码",[134],{"_61":132,"_25":66},"用途与特点","通过引擎集成连接角色与运行时对话、行为服务。Unity 指南包含安装、示例场景及角色设置，Unreal SDK 源码也已公开，浏览器体验需要账户。它为已有游戏提供 AI 行为，不生成完整游戏；公开 SDK 不包含全部托管 AI 服务。","detail","guidance","资源类型","工具","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production","tool",[164,165,166],{"_159":160,"_161":162,"_32":163},[158,119,120,121],[155,156,157],[154],"3d","code","scene","runtime","Runtime AI","tutorial",{"_61":95,"_25":96,"_17":159,"_83":97},"demo",{"_61":89,"_25":90,"_17":85,"_83":91},{"_61":81,"_25":82,"_17":75,"_83":84},{"_61":130,"_25":131},{"_61":129,"_25":82},{"_61":127,"_25":128},{"_168":169},"documents",{"_73":170,"_35":171},[173,177,178